(text "PROPOSAL ONLY: no PCB, no battery/charger/protection approval, no measured output current or source handover." (at 20.32 12.7 0)(effects (font (size 1.1 1.1))(justify left top))(uuid "a66916fd-5bba-52aa-8aa0-c1a715af33be"))
(text "No J4 / USB sense wire. Native XIAO 5V/VBUS and charge-port VBUS stay separate from this circuit." (at 20.32 17.78 0)(effects (font (size 1.1 1.1))(justify left top))(uuid "de487af2-9b96-5c36-b80a-234aa9bd3c5f"))
(text "J3 = XIAO BAT0 positive; J5 = XIAO GND. 2S raw battery NEVER connects to J3." (at 20.32 22.86 0)(effects (font (size 1.1 1.1))(justify left top))(uuid "77750e03-b089-505a-9f3c-46fd7582faaf"))
(text "U2 EN tied locally to VDD. MAX40200 detects reverse bias internally; switching transient limits remain unproven." (at 20.32 27.94 0)(effects (font (size 1.1 1.1))(justify left top))(uuid "6252637b-67dd-5999-9814-fd1eed9b8bea"))
(text "U1 EN tied to IN does NOT guarantee reverse protection. Startup overshoot and local capacitor discharge remain open." (at 20.32 33.02 0)(effects (font (size 1.1 1.1))(justify left top))(uuid "c6eac427-6c8b-548a-8cc2-88eccabfbf6b"))
(text "R3 keeps LDO load above 10mA; C2>=1uF, C3/C4>=0.33uF effective. Total OUT load capacitance <=100uF." (at 20.32 38.1 0)(effects (font (size 1.1 1.1))(justify left top))(uuid "2ff3a54e-7fe9-530b-a5d2-7bbeb677d587"))
(text "Use SOT23-5 limits: 175mV max drop at 500mA / 3.3V test point. WLP headline values do not apply." (at 20.32 43.18 0)(effects (font (size 1.1 1.1))(justify left top))(uuid "2a44c833-a76b-59a4-aa5e-42f630405be5"))
